.DS_Store
*.log

# Claude Code working directory — machine-specific, and none of it belongs in
# a public repo. It holds local settings (absolute paths, per-machine tool
# permissions), agent worktrees, and whatever scratch a session leaves behind.
#
# The whole directory, not just settings.local.json as before: nothing here is
# tracked, this repo is public, and one `git add -A` in a session is all it
# would take. Only a *global* gitignore protects the author's own machine;
# a contributor cloning this repo has no such protection.
#
# If a file under here ever IS worth sharing, `git add -f` it deliberately.
.claude/

# SDD scratch (progress ledger, task briefs)
.superpowers/
.airig/
